# ARCANUM XXII: the 22-colour palette of the internal card concept (ARCANUM XXII, 스물세 번째 패), used by the
# 〈고을 기담〉 prop tarot cards and the E5 night cuts of the no-hope pack. A palette of its own, like ui.pal:
# 33 keys share the 22 colours so the drawing keys stay readable (bone, flesh, water, ...).
# v0.5: old gold and moss corrected to the concept's exact values (825422, 465430).
K 0a060e void (outline)
n 0a060e void (night sky)
